      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Roughly four thousand remained by the Night of Sorrows.",
      "revealedIn": [{ "book": "wind-and-truth", "chapter": "47" }]
    },
    {
      "text": "Odium can restrict a Fused's access to its Surge.",
      "revealedIn": [{ "book": "wind-and-truth", "chapter": "56" }]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fused can use Warlight to fuel their powers.",
      "revealedIn": [{ "book": "wind-and-truth", "chapter": "147" }]
