        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": [
        {
          "text": "Human counterparts",
          "revealedIn": [{ "book": "wind-and-truth", "chapter": "128" }]
        }
      ],
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ishar used the Well of Control's power to create human counterparts of the Fused, reborn into willing hosts.",
          "revealedIn": [{ "book": "wind-and-truth", "chapter": "128" }]
        },
        {
          "text": "He can control their movements and kill them at will. Their presence can distort the lives and perceptions of people nearby.",
